# GDScript

- Godot 4 typed signatures (`-> void`, typed params).
- Indent with tabs.
- Movement on `CharacterBody2D` uses `velocity` + `move_and_slide()` in `_physics_process`.
- Tune gameplay numbers with `@export`.
- One script responsibility. Player does not own HUD or win screens.
- Use Input actions (`move_left`, `dash`, …), not raw keycodes.
